                    coach_header:           `Innovation Forum advisor & the board's quality committee`,
                    coach_intro:            `Innovation and quality are not separate agendas — they are levers on the same competitive-operations system, and choosing which innovation to pursue is itself an operations-strategy decision. Read your Pareto before you read your wish list: match the intervention to the root cause, reframe quality spend against the R$64,8 mi bleed, and remember the bind is delivery. Any project that takes a line down competes with the very CasaForte volume you are trying to protect.`,

